Thorium "Chrome 123 density" for the Thorium 2024 (Th24) UI.

Keeps Th24 shapes and colours but restores pre-Refresh Chrome (M123) spacing:
- toolbar: 34px location bar, 4/8px interior margins, wider icon spacing
- bookmark bar: 28px buttons + 4px margin, 8px icon-label padding
- Windows 10 menus: M123 separators (7/5/5), check-region reserve, padding
- app menu: no item icons (as in M123)
Only active when chrome://flags/#thorium-2024 is enabled.

